{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23260","headline":"与诸客空腹饮 · 白居易","name":"与诸客空腹饮","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"隔宿书招客，平明饮暖寒。\n麴神寅日合，酒圣卯时欢。\n促膝才飞白，酡颜已渥丹。\n碧筹攒米盌，红袖拂骰盘。\n醉後歌尤异，狂来舞不难。\n抛杯语同坐，莫作老人看。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23260.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23260","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}